    "semantics": "one bone per classic draw: <part>__i<k> is draw k of <part> (its cubes and pivot); step_scope part = the loop assigns the part's own axis channel, so the step is the clone's bind rotation under one hook-animated group <part>__fan; step_scope stack = the loop rotates the pose stack outside the part, so the step is the bind rotation of a per-draw parent <part>__fan<k> and the clone carries the part's animated channels"
